 weapons! Use weapons such as missiles, mines and traps to eliminate your friends!The four-person local online self-hi mode is easy to use, fast paced and full of joy!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Attention!</strong></h2><br>Game support: 1 or 4 handles, multiple keyboards. It’s up to you. Of course, we strongly recommend handle operation: D<br>( Only 4 players can play at most )<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Three different experience game modes<br></li><li>Unique retro pixel style<br></li><li>The cool cooperation that can’t be missed<br></li><li>Hard core game experience<br></li><li>All kinds of checkpoints<br></li><li>Steam achievements, Cloud Storage, Interchange Cards ( Later )<br></li><li>Interesting hidden levels await your exploration.</li></ul>",
